OL,3,GNEWSA'I've lost confidence in drinking
OL,4,Athe tap water'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family has been using bottled water
OL,7,Ffor more than four months while
OL,8,Fscientists have been investigating
OL,9,Funexplained debris in their water
OL,10,Fsupply.
OL,12,FAnnie and Phil Graham-Norgan, from Par
OL,13,Fin Cornwall, discovered particles in
OL,14,Ftheir tap water after the pressure
OL,15,Fsuddenly dropped. They said South West
OL,16,FWater carried out tests that showed the
OL,17,FpH level of the water was above the
OL,18,Fstandard limit.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
