OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1792043772
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'I've lost confidence in drinking
OL,4,Athe tap water'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth West Water apologised and
OL,7,Fconfirmed it had investigated the water
OL,8,Fsupply, replaced pipework, flushed the
OL,9,Fnetwork and amended supply
OL,10,Farrangements.
OL,12,FIt added: "Follow-up sampling at the
OL,13,Fproperty and across the wider network
OL,14,Fhas confirmed satisfactory water
OL,15,Fquality and has not identified any
OL,16,Fongoing water quality concerns."
